  "title": "C&F Financial Corporation Announces Appointment of New Board Member",
  "summary": "TOANO, Va., Jan. 23, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) - CF Financial Corporation (the Corporation) (NASDAQ:CFFI), the holding company for CF Bank, announced today that its Board of Directors has appointed Dr. David H. Downs to serve as a director of the Corporation effective February 24, 2026. Dr. Downs will also serve as a director of the Bank, where he has been a member of the CF Central Virginia Advisory Board for over 12 years. Dr. Downs is currently the Alfred L. Blake Endowed Chair Pr",
